WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.523
- Which character do you relate most to?

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.200
- Two characters leap to mind.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.253
One is Maude and the other is
Edith on All in the Family.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.465
She made it big.
- Love Bianca.

00:00:13.465 --> 00:00:15.140
I love her.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.670
- The loveliest human
being we all wrote for,

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.683
and this was her giant collaboration,

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.650
was Edith.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.160
And Maude made me laugh in places

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.443
in my body I didn't even know existed.

00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:31.946
- Yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:00:31.946 --> 00:00:32.779
I love that.

00:00:32.779 --> 00:00:33.790
I would've never guessed that,

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:34.800
and it's two women.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.310
That's amazing the characters you related

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.810
to weren't even men.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.900
So you just like to write
better characters for women?

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.277
I like you already (laughs).

00:00:42.272 --> 00:00:43.450
- I find I like women.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.770
- Yeah, you kinda like them? (laughs)

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.130
You invited all of us to your bed.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.632
Obviously, you like some of us (laughs).

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:50.550
- And that was the beginning.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.649
- Yeah, I know!

00:00:51.649 --> 00:00:52.870
We didn't even eat dinner.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:54.930
I like it, I like it, it's a cheap date.

